# Exclude data/'s contents and re-include the two files the demo stack serves.
# `data` + these negations also works with buildkit -- measured -- so this form
# is a preference, not a fix. What does NOT work is `data` with no negations at
# all, which is what shipped before #622 and left the corpus out of the image.
data/*
!data/corpus.jsonl
!data/corpora.json
indexes
models
*.db
*.sqlite
.env
.env.*
docker
tests
